{"id":"gewehr","lemma":"Gewehr","pos":"noun","rank":1599,"glosses":["rifle, long gun","tusks"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈveːɐ̯/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/84/De-Gewehr.ogg/De-Gewehr.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Gewehres","plural":"Gewehre"},"formAudio":{"Gewehres":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c6/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Gewehres.wav","Gewehre":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5e/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Gewehre.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich habe wirklich kein Gewehr.","en":"I don't really have a gun.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/761407","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"really, actually"},{"g":"no / not a"},null]},{"text":"Wem gehört das Gewehr?","en":"Who does the gun belong to?","words":[{"g":"who","l":"wer"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"},{"g":"the / that"},null]},{"text":"Hol mein Gewehr.","en":"Get my rifle.","words":[{"g":"to get, to fetch","l":"holen"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Er hat immer ein Gewehr dabei.","en":"He always walks with a rifle.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"at all times without…"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"with one, on one"}]},{"text":"Holen Sie mein Gewehr.","en":"Get my rifle.","words":[{"g":"to get, to fetch"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"my"},null]}]}